","nextNodeIds":[745250402,745250403]},{"nodeId":745250402,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2285035026,"text":"That's a serious face you're wearing there.","nextNodeIds":[745250404]},{"nodeId":745250404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30913,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":107896498,"text":"Ah, it's you. No, today's investigations are complete. Nothing unusual was found.","nextNodeIds":[745250405]},{"nodeId":745250405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30913,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":3962764058,"text":"I was just thinking about why those passing Eremites seemed so... listless.","nextNodeIds":[745250406,745250407]},{"nodeId":745250406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3238598890,"text":"A tiring journey, perhaps?","nextNodeIds":[745250408]},{"nodeId":745250408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30913,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":2611648242,"text":"My guess is that they may be in a \"mite\" of financial trouble. That sort of thing tends to the \"might\" out of \"Eremight.\"","nextNodeIds":[745250409,745250410]},{"nodeId":745250409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3144890554,"text":"How about something a \"might\" more cheerful?","nextNodeIds":[745250411]},{"nodeId":745250411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30913,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":183485082,"text":"Ah, I see. Still, if I were to just stand there, the resulting image might lack impact.","nextNodeIds":[745250412]},{"nodeId":745250412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30913,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":539267770,"text":"Don't worry, I'll use Electro. That should light-nings up a bit.","nextNodeIds":[745250413]},{"nodeId":745250413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":900678018,"text":"...Sounds like a plan. I'll make sure to catch you in action.","nextNodeIds":[745250414]},{"nodeId":745250414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30913,"speakerName":"Cyno","textMapHash":1207632786,"text":"Alright. It's in your hands. Don't miss out on the critical moment, now.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745250410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3256035258,"text":"Could I take a picture of you?","nextNodeIds":[745250411]},{"nodeId":745250407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1375943178,"text":"Did they fail in their mission?","nextNodeIds":[745250408]},{"nodeId":745250403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2633919266,"text":"Are you on the hunt for a criminal?","nextNodeIds":[745250404]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"7452501"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7452502,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":1537688004,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7452501,4],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_G